@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@esp32Id = 6afa730a3646abe5c575a606

### 1 - Ventilacao ON (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comandos
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-Key: {{devCommandKey}}

{"esp32Id":"{{esp32Id}}","tipo":"LIGAR_VENTILACAO"}

### 2 - Ventilacao OFF (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comandos
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-Key: {{devCommandKey}}

{"esp32Id":"{{esp32Id}}","tipo":"DESLIGAR_VENTILACAO"}

### 3 - Irrigar por 5 segundos (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comandos
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-Key: {{devCommandKey}}

{"esp32Id":"{{esp32Id}}","tipo":"ACIONAR_IRRIGACAO","valor":5}

### 4 - Irrigar por 15 segundos (201; testar parada em seguida)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comandos
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-Key: {{devCommandKey}}

{"esp32Id":"{{esp32Id}}","tipo":"ACIONAR_IRRIGACAO","valor":15}

### 5 - Parar irrigacao (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comandos
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-Key: {{devCommandKey}}

{"esp32Id":"{{esp32Id}}","tipo":"PARAR_IRRIGACAO"}

### Consultar fila sem interferir na execucao (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comandos/pendentes
X-IoT-Key: {{iotApiKey}}
